<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Bankamerica upped to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Bankamerica upped to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Deutsche Morgan Grenfell said analyst Joel Silverstein upgraded BankAmerica Corp to buy from hold.</p>
<p>-- increased &quot;core&quot; earnings estimates to $8.50 per share for 1997 and $9.70 for 1998.</p>
<p>-- stock price is &quot;among the cheapest in the group.&quot;</p>
<p>-- shares rose 1/8 to 95-1/4.</p>
</text>
